{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09889","headline":"秋夕读书幽兴献兵部李侍郎 · 岑参","name":"秋夕读书幽兴献兵部李侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"年纪蹉跎四十强，自怜头白始爲郎。\n雨滋苔藓侵堦绿，秋飒梧桐覆井黄。\n惊蝉也解求高树，旅雁还应厌後行。\n览卷试穿邻舍壁，明灯何惜借余光。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09889.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09889","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}